  "prefLabel": "Puc 1303.01 Voluntary Agreements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1303.01 Voluntary Agreements. A pole attachment agreement submitted to the commission for adjudication shall be deemed a voluntary agreement pursuant to RSA 374:34-a, VII. A party filing a petition under this part shall have the burden of proving that an agreement is not just, reasonable, and nondiscriminatory.\n\nSource. #9073, INTERIM, eff 1-17-08; ss by #9614, eff 12-12-09; ss by #12574, eff 9-1-18; ss by #13498, eff 12-1-22 (formerly Puc 1304.01) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Puc 1300)",
